sequenceDiagram
  participant Pipe as AuthorityPipelineStagesExecutor
  participant Stage as Knowledge graph stage
  participant KG as ArchLucid.KnowledgeGraph
  participant SQL as Tenant SQL catalog
  participant Outbox as Cosmos graph snapshot outbox
  Note over Pipe,Stage: OTel span authority.graph<br/>tag archlucid.stage.name

  Pipe->>Stage: Run after context ingestion
  Stage->>KG: Build / update provenance graph from context
  KG->>SQL: Persist graph snapshot JSON (authority-of-record)
  opt CosmosDb:GraphSnapshotsEnabled
    KG->>Outbox: Enlist CosmosGraphSnapshotOutbox same TX
  end
  Stage-->>Pipe: Stage complete → next authority.findings
